  "result": "Done! Added line discounts with full validation and updated totals calculation.\n\n**What was added:**\n\n1. **Discount validation** \u2014 New error code `DISCOUNT_INVALID`:\n   - discountPercent must be a number from 0\u2013100 (decimals like 12.5 are allowed)\n   - Invalid values rejected with DISCOUNT_INVALID\n\n2. **Enhanced createInvoice()** \u2014 Accepts { sku, qty, discountPercent } per line:\n   - discountPercent optional, defaults to 0\n   - Validates and stores on line\n\n3. **Enhanced addLine()** \u2014 Accepts discountPercent parameter:\n   - Validates discount\n   - Updates discount when adding to existing line\n   - Stores discount on new line\n\n4. **Updated invoiceTotals()** \u2014 Now returns { subtotal, discount, total }:\n   - **subtotal**: sum of all line totals\n   - **discount**: sum of line discounts (line total \u00d7 discountPercent / 100 per line, rounded)\n   - **total**: subtotal - discount, **clamped to 0** (no negative totals allowed)\n\n5. **Project decision applied** \u2014 All computed amounts are clamped to \u2265 0:\n   - Prevents negative totals even if discount exceeds subtotal\n\n6. **12 new tests** covering:\n   - Default discount (0)\n   - Valid discounts (integers and decimals like 12.5)\n   - Invalid discounts (>100, negative, non-numeric)\n   - Multiple lines with different discounts\n   - Discount clamping (negative totals become 0)\n   - addLine with discount updates\n\nAll 79 tests pass (12 new discount tests + 67 previous).",
